{"schema":"asx.scenario.v2","id":"region-close-outcome-join-panics-first-message-wins-001","description":"A region's close outcome carries the panic descriptor of the outcome that wins the join. r.two holds t.p1, which panics at 10 with \"first panic\", and t.p2, which panics at 20 with \"second panic\"; each timer fires in a step of its own (the anchors t.h1 to t.h3 are cancelled only so that the scheduler is not empty when the clock jumps to the next entry, whose step fires the timers that are due), so t.p1 completes first. Two Panicked outcomes join left-biased (Outcome::join keeps the left one on equal severity, types/outcome.rs:566-581): the close outcome read at 30 is Panicked with the first message. r.mixed holds t.q, which panics at 40 with \"q panics\", and t.k, cancelled User at 35: whichever of them completes first, the panic outranks the cancel and the close outcome read at 50 is Panicked with t.q's message.","unit":"region_lifecycle","rules":["def.outcome.severity_lattice","def.outcome.join_semantics","def.outcome.four_valued"],"seed":42,"lab":{"max_steps":2000},"regions":[{"name":"r.main","parent":"root","budget":null},{"name":"r.two","parent":"root","budget":null},{"name":"r.mixed","parent":"root","budget":null}],"channels":[],"sync":[],"tasks":[{"name":"t.p1","region":"r.two","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":10},{"op":"return","outcome":{"tag":"panicked","message":"first panic"}}]},{"name":"t.p2","region":"r.two","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":20},{"op":"return","outcome":{"tag":"panicked","message":"second panic"}}]},{"name":"t.q","region":"r.mixed","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":40},{"op":"return","outcome":{"tag":"panicked","message":"q panics"}}]},{"name":"t.k","region":"r.mixed","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":1000},{"op":"checkpoint"}]},{"name":"t.h1","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":1000},{"op":"checkpoint"}]},{"name":"t.h2","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":1000},{"op":"checkpoint"}]},{"name":"t.h3","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":1000},{"op":"checkpoint"}]},{"name":"t.h4","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":1000},{"op":"checkpoint"}]},{"name":"t.m","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":300},{"op":"trace","message":"m done"}]}],"script":[{"at_ns":12,"op":{"op":"cancel_task","task":"t.h1","kind":"User"}},{"at_ns":15,"op":{"op":"cancel_task","task":"t.h2","kind":"User"}},{"at_ns":25,"op":{"op":"cancel_task","task":"t.h3","kind":"User"}},{"at_ns":30,"op":{"op":"region_close_outcome","region":"r.two"}},{"at_ns":35,"op":{"op":"cancel_task","task":"t.k","kind":"User"}},{"at_ns":45,"op":{"op":"cancel_task","task":"t.h4","kind":"User"}},{"at_ns":50,"op":{"op":"region_close_outcome","region":"r.mixed"}}],"expect":{"kind":"ok"}}
